[[File:ADnD2eRev.png|300px|center|AD&D 2nd Edition Revised]]

* ''April 25'': A revised version of the AD&D 2nd Edition is released, bringing with it a new AD&D logo (which drops the "2nd Edition"). All Planescape products starting with May's ''A Player's Primer to the Outlands'' bear the new logo (including reprints of earlier titles).
** {{dd|Player's Handbook (2e revised)|alt=Player's Handbook|pdf=16868|nip=1}}, referenced in:
