[[File:ADnD2eRev.png|300px|center|AD&D 2nd Edition Revised]]
{{timeline|1997}}

Deep in dept, TSR sells itself to Wizards of the Coast. Due to the surrounding issues, few products are released in the first half of the year, and nothing at all for Planescape.

== January ==
** {{dd|Monstrous Compendium Annual Volume Three|pdf=16906}}
*** {{b|Planescape|The Inner Planes|pdf=17296|nip=1}}

== July ==
* Released:
